<title>JAPAN: Tama Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tama Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.69		vs	    4.88</p>
<p> Operating	   26    million    vs	   20    million</p>
<p> Current	     17    million    vs	   39    million</p>
<p> Net		  prft 2 million    vs    loss 46    million</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 0.29 yen	  vs     loss 4.88 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Tama Electric Co Ltd specialises in the production of resistors.</p>
</text>
